{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣「棒棒堂」成員小煜（楊奇煜）去年9月與老婆言言離婚，目前養育2個兒子，台媒昨日（18日）報道指，恢復單身後的小煜已經遷出過往與前妻的愛巢，且被發現與長腿美女深夜駕電單車約會，期間還被直擊亂拋垃圾，對此小煜已鄭重道歉。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T18:24:29.565214+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T18:17:37.337793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T18:17:37.337793+00:00","content_hash":"e2e52b5cf738f6d15f5e61247ca8b4dedc0d61691a54b48fcae668ab71953a5c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}